# §8 operator-directed deviation
#
# This directory holds the local review-queue cache for the music-video
# and faceless-short missions.  Per [[outputs-publish-deviation]] the
# outputs/ tree carries §8 markers wherever it deviates from the strict
# "all mission output under records/" rule.  Here the deviation is
# intentional: review-queue/ is the post-render staging area where the
# operator drains a batched taste-decision queue instead of getting
# pinged per-render (reduces operator-intervention events ~10x without
# changing the total decision count — see lever 3 in
# docs/research/2026-05-22-intervention-reduction.md).
#
# Only README.md and this .gitkeep are tracked.  pending/ and decided/
# subdirs are gitignored.
